{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 30,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll explain more at the end, but let me set up this clip in five words:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4720,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "robot killers, Stephen Fry,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7689,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "watch"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10179,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Autonomous weapons have been described as the third revolution in warfare"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14650,
    "dDurationMs": 2809,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after gunpowder and nuclear bombs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18130,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They could mount rapid devastating attacks on a huge scale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23230,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thousands of experts including Elon Musk and Stephen Hawking have signed an open letter calling for a ban on the weapons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38110,
    "dDurationMs": 5270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They say drones that can autonomously find and eliminate people meeting certain criteria"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43930,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are feasible within years, not decades"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49020,
    "dDurationMs": 6800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But calls for a ban have been rejected by the world's 10 largest military powers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56160,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Musk has warned that international competition for AI superiority"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61020,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the most likely cause of World War 3"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65620,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, do we have a recipe for disaster?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70020,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's start with the current situation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72760,
    "dDurationMs": 7100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "During Obama's presidency the number of American troops in war zones dropped by around 90 percent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79860,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there were ten times more drone strikes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83620,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Russia has multiple unmanned drone tanks in development"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88100,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and completely autonomous armed vehicles guarding missile bases"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93500,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "America plans to enable its Abrams tanks to control robotic wingman vehicles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98960,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to attack the enemy while protecting the manned tank"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103400,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is also considering a remote-controlled version of the high speed ripsaw vehicle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109080,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Air power is already used with relative impunity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113140,
    "dDurationMs": 6060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And soon the fighters will use AI to control drone wingmen able to carry weapons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119620,
    "dDurationMs": 5449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "test air defenses and keep human pilots even further from danger"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126100,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Around the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127690,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "anti-ballistic missile defenses and drones are diminishing nuclear deterrence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134040,
    "dDurationMs": 7640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the US Navy's new unmanned ship designed to hunt submarines and launch surface weapons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141720,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It will cost around 20 thousand dollars per day to operate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145600,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "compared to 700 thousand dollars per day for a manned destroyer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151060,
    "dDurationMs": 6760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a simulation test with the Air Force Research Lab AI drones repeatedly defeated a human pilot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158300,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Former Air Force battle manager Jean Lee tried and failed to hit the drones"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163840,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and was destroyed by them every time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167580,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He said they seemed to be aware of his intention"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171140,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and reacted instantly to his movements and attacks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175820,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Autonomous weapons would be cheap to mass-produce"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178620,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and may become available to terrorists and dictators on the black market"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184080,
    "dDurationMs": 7260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A recent report by the US defense Science Board called for immediate action to accelerate military AI development"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191340,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and understand the capabilities of other powers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194760,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It also noted that commercial drones are rapidly improving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198340,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and private AI firms are well ahead of the military"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203980,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some argue AI will reduce accidental casualties by making fewer mistakes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210100,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If a soldier believes someone is a threat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212860,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their life depends on making a quick decision"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216260,
    "dDurationMs": 7560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A robot on the other hand could react a fraction of a second before it's fired on or even wait until it's attacked"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224140,
    "dDurationMs": 7140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the weapons could also be extremely effective at assassinations, subduing populations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231280,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and selectively killing particular ethnic groups"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235660,
    "dDurationMs": 7660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second revolution in warfare brought the world close to World War 3 with the Cuban Missile Crisis"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243320,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The third revolution may be even more volatile"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247400,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We also need to plan for an even greater threat from AI itself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252980,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Many experts believe it will surpass human intelligence in the next few decades"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258800,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It may then assume full control of the world's networked weapons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263960,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Would it use them for peacekeeping?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266900,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or for bringing humanity to a quick end?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270760,
    "dDurationMs": 8160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether or not humans retain control and AI arms race may be a race to Armageddon"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280920,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We believe a ban that's difficult to enforce is better than a world flooded"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286720,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with cheap anonymous autonomous weapons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294500,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you think?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303920,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I hope you enjoyed that clip or were frightened by it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308120,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me know what you thought in the comments below"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310190,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That clip was actually made by friends of mine who run a YouTube channel called Pindex"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314230,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They make incredibly high quality educational videos"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317700,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you want to check them out, I will put a link in the description and one up here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322060,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, you know whenever I see those Boston Dynamics videos come out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325760,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm always simultaneously amazed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328220,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the achievements that they've been able to produce"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331300,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and simultaneously scared that I'm watching the birth of the ancestors of our future robot overlords"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338740,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, yeah, I've got mixed feelings about this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341650,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I think it's a really important topic and that's why I wanted to share this clip with you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345800,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I also wanted to highlight the fine work of the guys over at Pindex, so yeah, definitely check them out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351540,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and for those of you who are asking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353030,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derrick what about your videos? Why haven't you been posting very much lately?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357320,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I have been working on some stuff"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359380,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, I've got a full-length 90-minute documentary coming out in the summer of this year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364040,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It'll be available globally"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366020,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so watch out for that. I will be giving you some updates closer to the day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369960,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I also have a pilot for a brand new series"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373660,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I worked on with minutephysics and MinuteEarth, I will put a link in the description"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377400,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you're in the U.S., you can go check it out. Other places are geo-blocked"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381830,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know I can't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383510,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "say anything for that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384550,
    "dDurationMs": 5030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's our intention to try to get this series out to as many people around the world as we possibly can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389940,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you can check it out, go and do that now and I will be posting some more videos soon"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396060,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I promise and hopefully it will"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399140,
    "dDurationMs": 6020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "explain why I've been absent for some of this time, so yeah. I hope you enjoyed that clip"
    } ]
  } ]
}
